  "description": "STMicroelectronics USBLC6-2 very low capacitance ESD protection array in SOT23-6L: two protected data lines (I/O1 on pins 1/6, I/O2 on pins 3/4, flow-through) and VBUS (pin 5), rail-to-rail clamp topology. 3.5 pF max line capacitance, 150 nA max leakage at 5.25 V, 6 V min VBUS breakdown, 17 V max clamping at 5 A (8/20 us). IEC 61000-4-2 level 4 (15 kV air, 8 kV contact; 15 kV contact absolute rating). For USB 2.0 up to 480 Mb/s, Ethernet 10/100 and video lines.",
